DESCRIPTION:A comedy harp concert\, what an original premise\, maybe just c
 ome for that? 'Clearly destined for big things\, Hickman is equipped with a
  voice filled with operatic drama' (Chortle.co.uk). 'Sensational' (Comedy.c
 o.uk). Unapologetically queer\, gorgeous and filthy\; join Hickman on a mad
  romp through love\, romance\, sex\, friendship\, motherhood\, trauma\, the
  2002 television series Monk\, and Jesus. 'Michelle Visage mixed with the m
 usical and comedic ability of Victoria Wood' (BroadwayBaby.com). This show 
 is mostly about religious trauma and medical transition. FUN! 'The showgirl
  on the harp' (BBC Wales).\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas
 /event/sam-hickman-first-woman/
